rust-rl third-party components

Cargo.lock identifies the dependency versions used by this workspace.
Dependencies are retrieved from their published package registry and are
distributed under their respective terms.

The portable viewer distributions include the applicable original notices for
linked dependencies, embedded fonts, generated graphics bindings and toolchain
runtime code. The archives also include the corresponding source for the
MPL-2.0 component colored 3.1.1.

The viewer uses the default fonts supplied by egui, including Hack Regular,
Ubuntu Light and the egui icon subset. Their notices accompany the portable
viewer. The screenshots in this repository are native captures of the viewer.

The rocket and trade execution recordings are generated from the included
simulators. They contain no empirical market feed or external scenario data.
